    "descriptionZh": "社区维护的图标库，按一套严格的绘制规则做出上千枚 SVG，可按需 tree-shake，React、Vue、Svelte、Angular、React Native 等都有对应包。给要统一图标风格的前端。",
    "takeawayZh": "搜 1847 枚图标，按需 import 进你用的框架",
    "noteZh": "首屏标题是 Beautiful & consistent icons 配一句 Made by the community.，左边挂着 v1.46.0 和 🚀 Version 1 两枚标签，三颗按钮是 View all icons / Get Started / GitHub；标题下面直接接 Search 1847 icons... Ctrl+K 的搜索框，右侧是一团灰色大螺旋插画。再往下是 Lightweight & Scalable、Clean & consistent、Customizable、Packages support、Tree shakable、Active community 六张特性卡。底部写明 Released under the ISC License，并链到 Contribute 与 Changelog。",
